{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-co2-lp-dual-binding","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Proposition","doco:Section"],"label":"prop:co2-lp-dual-binding","kind":"proposition","title":"LP dual selects linear $O{=}C{=}O$ geometry","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/conj-q-integer-mass-formula","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-co2-molecular-braid","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-co-lp-dual-binding"],"tags":["CO2","LP-dual","linear","geometry","double-bond"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.Molecular.co2_lp_dual_binding","text":"co2-lp-dual-binding.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"prop:co2-lp-dual-binding\"></a><p><strong>Conditional on <a href=\"#conj:q-integer-mass-formula\">Seven-term atomic mass formula with <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code>-integer coefficients</a>.</strong>\n<em>The LP dual of the <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">CO_2</code> molecular braid selects the symmetric linear arrangement O=C=O with two double bonds as the ground state. It minimises <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\Phi_1</code> over all possible:</em></p>\n<ol>\n<li><em>Bond order assignments: <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(k_1, k_2)</code> with <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">k_1 + k_2 \\leq 4</code> (carbon's valence).</em></li>\n<li><em>Electron-bond assignments: which electrons are shared with which oxygen.</em></li>\n<li><em>Strand orderings: permutations of 66 strands.</em></li>\n</ol>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/molecular-construction/co2-lp-dual-binding.md","heading":"Proposition","number":"18.6.3","page":"b/prop-co2-lp-dual-binding","qa":{"counts":{"pass":92,"fail":0,"warn":1,"na":12,"unknown":0,"stale":79},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.Observations.co2_lp_dual_binding","via":"ref","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/co2_lp_dual_binding.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
